    "title": "Car crashes into Castro Valley 7-Eleven - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By KTVU Staff ,\n17 hours ago CASTRO VALLEY, Calif. - A car smashed into the front of a 7-Eleven convenience store in Castro Valley on Wednesday evening. According to the Alameda County Fire Department, a report came in around 6:23 p.m. regarding a crash at a 7-Eleven in the 22000 block of Redwood Road. Injuries reported. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
